头文件中同步实施，保证了代码逻辑的一致性。","created_at":"2026-04-10T09:16:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-10T09:16:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167890151,"discussion_id":"419fe547e021c6dc927dea3a124f04ce7705b38b","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-10T10:30:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-10T10:30:09+08:00","user":{"id":"67c95566d8431207adc9dd2b","login":"qq_48757028","object_id":"67c95566d8431207adc9dd2b","name":"liangzhuo66","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fb/8ef13f960ba0a07eb689409ac66c60d8fc41a8357d12817832157c7f72c75d6b.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/qq_48757028"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167890422,"discussion_id":"0a775f71c40c2028922059a5491cb1220ae79a99","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=c844ee1245424241bb90ceae7eca23dd&projectName=CANN'>c844ee1245424241bb90ceae7eca23dd</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=c844ee1245424241bb90ceae7eca23dd&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/3970/cann-ops-transformer-experimental_linux-x86_64.run>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n      